# Design copy

Match the original Figma designs, including sentence case and intentional emphasis such as `Day`, `Goal`, and `DOUBLE Success!`.

- Use sentence case for supporting flows without a Figma reference.
- Preserve user-entered names and habits, locale-formatted dates, acronyms and external messages.
- Do not apply blanket lowercase or uppercase transformations to UI text.
- Keep machine identifiers, routes, comparison normalization and stored values separate from display copy.
